--- 030_auth_tenant.sql ---
Changed database context to 'testTemplateFresh'.
Tenancy tables: no problems found.
 
Severity    Status     Item                                                                                                                                                                                                     Detail                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
----------- ---------- -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
          4 OK         Table auth.Application                                                                                                                                                                                   The outermost scope. D-09.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
          4 OK         Table auth.TenantType                                                                                                                                                                                    Descriptive types. Section 5.2.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
          4 OK         Table auth.Tenant                                                                                                                                                                                        The hierarchy. Sections 5.1 and 15.2.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
          4 OK         Table auth.TenantClosure                                                                                                                                                                                 The transitive closure. Section 5.3.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
          4 OK         INV-02 (b) CK_auth_Tenant_RootHasNoParent                                                                                                                                                                Ties ParentTenantId IS NULL to TenantTypeCode = Root, in both directions. Without it a non-root could have no parent and become a second root, or a tenant typed Root could be hung under another node.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
          4 OK         INV-02 (a) UX_auth_Tenant_ApplicationRoot                                                                                                                                                                At most one parentless tenant per application. A filtered unique index is the only declarative way to say that -- a CHECK cannot count rows and a trigger can be disabled.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
          4 OK         UX_auth_Tenant_Id_Application                                                                                                                                                                            The unfiltered (TenantId, ApplicationId) pair that FK_auth_Role_OwnerTenant references in 055_auth_role.sql, so a role cannot be owned by a tenant belonging to another application. It looks redundant against PK_auth_Tenant and is not: a FOREIGN KEY needs a declared key over exactly these two columns. BL-040.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
          4 OK         Audit trigger auth.trg_au_updt_Application                                                                                                                                                               Maintains auditModifiedBy, auditModifiedDateUtc and the soft-delete stamp. Without it every UPDATE leaves the audit columns at their insert-time values -- and auth.uspRebuildTenantClosure is all UPDATEs.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
          4 OK         Audit trigger auth.trg_au_updt_TenantType                                                                                                                                                                Maintains auditModifiedBy, auditModifiedDateUtc and the soft-delete stamp. Without it every UPDATE leaves the audit columns at their insert-time values -- and auth.uspRebuildTenantClosure is all UPDATEs.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
          4 OK         Audit trigger auth.trg_au_updt_Tenant                                                                                                                                                                    Maintains auditModifiedBy, auditModifiedDateUtc and the soft-delete stamp. Without it every UPDATE leaves the audit columns at their insert-time values -- and auth.uspRebuildTenantClosure is all UPDATEs.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
          4 OK         Audit trigger auth.trg_au_updt_TenantClosure                                                                                                                                                             Maintains auditModifiedBy, auditModifiedDateUtc and the soft-delete stamp. Without it every UPDATE leaves the audit columns at their insert-time values -- and auth.uspRebuildTenantClosure is all UPDATEs.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
          4 OK         Seeded tenant types                                                                                                                                                                                      7 of 7 live. Seeded here rather than in 115_seed_reference_data.sql because a tenant cannot be inserted before its type exists. Fewer than 7 is not necessarily wrong -- the MERGE does not resurrect a type a project deliberately withdrew -- but Root must be present or no tree can be built.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
          4 OK         Tenant type Root                                                                                                                                                                                         CK_auth_Tenant_RootHasNoParent names this code as a literal, so without the row no root tenant can be inserted and no tree can exist.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
          4 OK         Applications with more than one live root tenant                                                                                                                                                         0 found. Anything but 0 means INV-02 has been broken, which would make "the agency can see everything" ambiguous -- two roots means two answers to the same scope question.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
          4 OK         Live tenants whose parent is in another application                                                                                                                                                      0 found. No constraint can express this -- a composite foreign key onto (TenantId, ApplicationId) would do it, and is not worth a second unique index on a table this small -- so auth.uspUpdateTenant raises 50096 and this count is the standing check that nothing else got there first.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
          4 OK         auth.TenantClosure coverage                                                                                                                                                                              3 live pairs for 2 tenants, 0 tenants with no depth-0 self row. Empty on a fresh install is expected: the closure is derived, and auth.uspRebuildTenantClosure arrives with database/125_auth_tenant_procedures.sql. A tenant with no self row is STALE -- every scope test against it fails closed, so authority silently disappears rather than leaking.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
          4 OK         Column descriptions on the four tenancy tables                                                                                                                                                           47 of 47 columns carry MS_Description. Conventions rule 4. If Missing is not 0 and util.uspSetObjectDescription exists, a column was added to this script without a description row in section 6.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       


