          4 OK         Table auth.User                                                                                                                                                                                          The person. Not tenant-scoped -- section 6.1.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
          4 OK         Index UX_auth_User_UserName                                                                                                                                                                              UNIQUE where IsDeleted = 0. UserName is the natural key.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
          4 OK         Index IX_auth_User_Email                                                                                                                                                                                 NON-UNIQUE, deliberately: a unique index on email refuses a new starter who inherited an address, and refuses a marriage.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
          4 OK         Index IX_auth_User_PlatformAdmin                                                                                                                                                                         Filtered on IsPlatformAdmin = 1, so enumerating the holders is a seek -- INV-09.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
          4 OK         auth.User.Email carries no UNIQUE index                                                                                                                                                                  A unique index on Email refuses a legitimate new starter who inherited a predecessor's address and refuses somebody who marries, and the workaround for both is an edit to another person's row. Email is never an identity key here -- INV-07.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
          4 OK         Trigger auth.trg_au_updt_User                                                                                                                                                                            AFTER UPDATE audit stamp, and the guard that makes UserName immutable -- E-50010.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
          4 OK         Table auth.UserProfile                                                                                                                                                                                   One hat: a person acting for one organization. The pivot of the authorization model -- section 8.3. Its presence is also what stops the runner skipping 090_dbo_application.sql.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
          4 OK         Index UX_auth_UserProfile_Default                                                                                                                                                                        UNIQUE on (UserId) WHERE IsDefault = 1 AND IsDeleted = 0 -- INV-03, exactly one default profile per person.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
          4 OK         Index UX_auth_UserProfile_UserTenantName                                                                                                                                                                 UNIQUE on (UserId, TenantId, ProfileName) where live. An addition to section 15.4 -- BL-036: two identically named profiles at one tenant are indistinguishable in the switcher.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
          4 OK         Index IX_auth_UserProfile_User                                                                                                                                                                           The profile switcher's only query, run on every sign-in.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
