          3 PENDING    Seeding or loading the demo tables now needs a bypass                                                                                                                                                    dbo.CaseFile and dbo.CaseNote are protected from this point on, including from the deploying account. A fixture or seed must either set SESSION_CONTEXT ('BypassRowSecurity') or act as a profile that holds Data.Insert at the acting tenant. database/_tests/060_row_security.sql does both, deliberately.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
