          4 OK         SCHEMA::config carries SELECT for both reading roles                                                                                                                                                     2 of 2 expected schema-level SELECT grants. This is the hole G-19 was filed for: config was created in 005, filled in 025 and read by every procedure in 110 without one role being granted or denied anything in it.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
          4 OK         config.ApplicationSetting is denied to both reading roles, so the pepper is unreadable                                                                                                                   2 of 2 expected object-level DENYs. Authn.DummyVerifierPepper is the whole basis of section 19.2: a caller who can read it can compute the dummy verifier for any name and enumerate every account with no extra requests. The procedures still read the table, by ownership chaining, which is measured in this file's banner rather than assumed.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
          4 OK         INV-11 is now a catalog row: applicationRole is denied all four table verbs on SCHEMA::auth                                                                                                              4 of 4 expected verbs denied. The invariant used to hold because nothing had been granted, which is not the same as holding -- it would have stopped holding the first time somebody added a convenience SELECT. The fifteen EXECUTE grants are unaffected: ownership chaining does not consult this deny.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
          3 INFO       util.uspSetObjectDescription: EXECUTE is not granted to any role                                                                                                                                         EXECUTE on SCHEMA::util is deliberately not denied at schema level: measured, a schema DENY beats the object-level GRANT that 000_prerequisites.sql makes on util.uspPhase0Probe, and the Phase 0 connectivity probe would have started failing for a reason nobody would trace back here. The table verbs ARE denied.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
